+// Measured on the host tier (`-ncmoe 48`, `-c 131072`, arena 13.3 GiB, 3 x R9700, 3 slots, 71k + 23k + an 800-token
+// generation, two rounds):
+//     aux  3584 (flat)  -> fails, ~88 s in, on the post-prefill narrow re-reserve
+//     aux  4096 (+512)  -> fails, same place
